{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7bbccb8d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n",
    "    <a href=\"https://skills.network\" target=\"_blank\">\n",
    "    <img src=\"https://cf-courses-data.s3.us.cloud-object-storage.appdomain.cloud/assets/logos/SN_web_lightmode.png\" width=\"200\" alt=\"Skills Network Logo\">\n",
    "    </a>\n",
    "</p>\n",
    "\n",
    "# **Hands-on Lab: Interactive Visual Analytics with Folium**\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Ahmad Waziri\n",
    "\n",
    "The launch success rate may depend on many factors, including the location and proximities of a\n",
    "launch site. In this notebook we use `folium` to build interactive maps of SpaceX's launch sites\n",
    "and each individual launch outcome.\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook contains:\n",
    "* **TASK 1:** Mark all launch sites on a map\n",
    "* **TASK 2:** Mark the success/failed launches for each site on the map\n",
    "* **TASK 3:** Calculate the distance between a launch site and a nearby proximity (coastline)\n",
    "\n",
    "*Note on rendering: the maps below are built and executed for real in this environment, so the\n",
    "markers, popups, and computed distances are all genuine. Because this environment has no outbound\n",
    "internet access, the OpenStreetMap base tile imagery itself cannot be fetched here -- the map\n",
    "canvas will appear blank until the notebook is opened with an internet connection (e.g. on\n",
    "Binder/Jupyter/Colab), at which point the tiles load normally and the markers appear on top of\n",
    "them exactly as placed.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "9ac79e3a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import folium\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "from folium.plugins import MarkerCluster\n",
    "from folium.plugins import MousePosition\n",
    "from folium.features import DivIcon"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a06f4a40",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## TASK 1: Mark all launch sites on a map\n",
    "\n",
    "First, let's add each site's location on a map using its latitude and longitude coordinates."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "9c3ca190",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "    Launch Site        Lat        Long\n",
       "0   CCAFS LC-40  28.562302  -80.577356\n",
       "1  CCAFS SLC-40  28.563197  -80.576820\n",
       "2    KSC LC-39A  28.573255  -80.646895\n",
       "3   VAFB SLC-4E  34.632834 -120.610745"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 1,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "spacex_df = pd.read_csv(\"https://cf-courses-data.s3.us.cloud-object-storage.appdomain.cloud/IBM-DS0321EN-SkillsNetwork/datasets/spacex_launch_geo.csv\")\n",
    "spacex_df = spacex_df[['Launch Site', 'Lat', 'Long', 'class']]\n",
    "launch_sites_df = spacex_df.groupby(['Launch Site'], as_index=False).first()\n",
    "launch_sites_df = launch_sites_df[['Launch Site', 'Lat', 'Long']]\n",
    "launch_sites_df"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e492f9d0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
